    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 视频声称\n",
      "x": 702,
      "y": 102,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 提取状态\n- 当前只有 metadata / notes 模板，尚无完整转写稿。\n- 2026-05-13 曾尝试下载并转写该 22分51秒长视频，命令运行约30分钟后超时，只保留 metadata，已删除不…",
      "x": 312,
      "y": 414,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "因未取得正文，本页只能保留研究框架和待补提取清单，不能写成视频结论。",
      "x": 535,
      "y": 579,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 关键主题\n- 芯片：GPU/ASIC/CPU分工\n- PCB：高多层、HDI趋势",
      "x": -312,
      "y": 414,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "6",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "光模块：速率升级",
      "x": -394,
      "y": 619,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "6",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "交换机：数据中心网络",
      "x": -535,
      "y": 579,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "6",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 已补转写，待分析（22分钟长视频）\n- 从转写稿提炼 AI大基建泡沫论的核心论据与反驳论据。\n- 六大环节中哪个环节\"泡沫最大\"vs\"最扎实\"？",
      "x": -702,
      "y": 102,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "7",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "各环节龙头公司有哪些？",
      "x": -1027,
      "y": 192,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "7",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n16",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "视频对2026年AI资本开支的判断是什么？",
      "x": -1062,
      "y": 103,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "7",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n17",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 可先建立的核验框架\n- 环节 / 需要从视频提取 / 需要外部核验\n- 芯片 / GPU/ASIC/CPU如何分工，国产替代和供给瓶颈 / 海外GPU供给、国产芯片出货、客户验证",
      "x": -563,
